    <!--
        Notification wording pools. One line is picked per reminder (deterministically, so the same reminder never
        changes its words). Arguments: %1$s title, %2$s when-phrase, %3$s clock time, %4$s age (birthdays).
        The notification title already carries the item's name.
    -->

